{
  "id": "962",
  "title": "How much do two people eat?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2020-01-01",
  "synopsis": "Li doesn’t know how many dishes are suitable for two people, so he asks the waiter.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/962/fffae31205350d6bfcc27f9f506646b3e0717877.mp3?1591186083",
  "series": {
    "title": "Newbie Course 2: Lunch Date with Li",
    "chapter": 5,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "两个人吃多少？\n\nLi：你好！我们两个人吃十个菜，多吗？\nWaiter：太多了。\nLi：两个人吃一个菜？少吗？\nWaiter：太少了。\nLi：那两个人吃多少？\nWaiter：三个菜。\nLi：好，谢谢你！\nWaiter：不客气！",
    "traditional": "兩個人吃多少？\n\nLi：你好！我們兩個人吃十個菜，多嗎？\nWaiter：太多了。\nLi：兩個人吃一個菜？少嗎？\nWaiter：太少了。\nLi：那兩個人吃多少？\nWaiter：三個菜。\nLi：好，謝謝你！\nWaiter：不客氣！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "How much do two people eat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "Li：你好！我们两个人吃十个菜，多吗？",
      "traditional": "Li：你好！我們兩個人吃十個菜，多嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo wǒ men liǎng ge rén chī shí ge cài duō ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: Hello! For the two of us to eat ten dishes, is that too much?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "Waiter：太多了。",
      "traditional": "Waiter：太多了。",
      "pinyin": "tài duō le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: That’s too much."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "Li：两个人吃一个菜？少吗？",
      "traditional": "Li：兩個人吃一個菜？少嗎？",
      "pinyin": "liǎng ge rén chī yí ge cài shǎo ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: Two people eating one dish then? Is that too little?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "Waiter：太少了。",
      "traditional": "Waiter：太少了。",
      "pinyin": "tài shǎo le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: That’s too little."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "Li：那两个人吃多少？",
      "traditional": "Li：那兩個人吃多少？",
      "pinyin": "nà liǎng ge rén chī duō shao",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: Then how much do two people eat?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "Waiter：三个菜。",
      "traditional": "Waiter：三個菜。",
      "pinyin": "sān ge cài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: Three dishes."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "Li：好，谢谢你！",
      "traditional": "Li：好，謝謝你！",
      "pinyin": "hǎo xiè xie nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li: Ok, thank you!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "Waiter：不客气！",
      "traditional": "Waiter：不客氣！",
      "pinyin": "bú kè qi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Waiter: You’re welcome!"
    }
